# Reviewed exceptions for tests/public-hygiene.sh.
# Format: path:regex  (path may be a bash glob; regex is ERE matched against
# the offending line, or against the path itself for binary/size findings).
# Keep this list short and explain each entry.

# The support-bundle redactor must recognise 1Password secret references.
packages/omarchy-jetson-observability/omarchy-jetson-support:op://
# Its test feeds a sample secret reference through the redactor.
tests/observability.sh:op://

# Generated from upstream Omarchy's own menu (scripts/generate-menu-extension.py),
# which ships its own agent entries.
packages/omarchy-jetson-upstream/default-menu-extension.jsonc:[Hh]ermes
